		{
			x: 0.0d
			y: 2.5d
			description: [
				"When you first time open enchanting table, it will be different from vanilla minecraft"
				"You will find 3 new lines:"
				"Eterna"
				"Quanta"
				"Arcana"
				""
				"First of all, eterna. All \"vanilla\" bookshelf now give you a little bit of eterna, BUT it will eventually reach it limit."
				"The more eterna you get - more levels enchanting table will consume and higher lvl enchantments will appear"
				""
				"Quanta is the second line. The higher the value - more enchantments you'll get. Beware with the chance to get regular enchantments, grows the chance to get curse enchantment"
				""
				"And the last one - Arcana"
				"Arcana controls rarity of enchantments."
				"Btw if you want to get more info - go read \"book of shadows\""
				""
				"There is also good combinations of different shelf, you better try them out"
			]
			dependencies: ["6028849F1BBE6A76"]
